---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="The Daily Wire — AcquireWire" description="One email, every weekday morning. The most important move in markets and M&A, explained." active="newsletter">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page read" style="text-align:center">
      <h1>The Daily Wire</h1>
      <p class="lede">One email, every weekday morning. The deal that mattered — with the numbers and the so-what.</p>

      <section class="newsletter" style="margin-top:8px">
        <span class="eyebrow">Free · No spam · Unsubscribe anytime</span>
        <h2>Join the desk.</h2>
        <p>Get the sharpest read on M&amp;A, private capital, and markets before your first coffee.</p>
        <form class="nl-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); this.querySelector('input').value=''; this.querySelector('input').placeholder='Thanks — check your inbox.';">
          <input type="email" required placeholder="you@firm.com" aria-label="Email address" />
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
        </form>
      </section>

      <div class="prose" style="text-align:left">
        <h2>What you'll get</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>One story, done properly.</strong> The single most important move, explained — not a link dump.</li>
          <li><strong>The numbers first.</strong> Valuations, multiples, run rates. Then what they mean.</li>
          <li><strong>Both sides.</strong> The risk and the bull case, every time.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
